Package: com.551.islandbatterynotch
Name: Dynamic Island Battery Notch
Version: 0.2.27
Architecture: iphoneos-arm64
Description: Shows your battery level as a coloured line around the Dynamic Island. The line gets shorter as your battery runs down. Choose your colours, charging pulse and line thickness. The outline also adjusts for the Lock Screen and screen recording. For iPhone 14 Pro Max on iOS 16 (rootless).
Maintainer: 551UK
Author: 551UK
Section: Tweaks
Depends: mobilesubstrate, preferenceloader
